<title>FRANCE: Heavy rains kill four in Algeria.</title>
<headline>Heavy rains kill four in Algeria.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heavy rains on Saturday killed four people and made 600 families homeless in southern Algeria, state-run radio said.</p>
<p>Two children were among the dead in Ain Guezam area, some 1,550 km (960 miles) from Algiers, the radio said.</p>
<p>Rain is rare in the summer in southern Algeria where temperatures exceed 50 degrees Celsuis early in August.</p>
</text>
